+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Property-based tests (hegel). Shared generators live in `super::gens`
+// (src/tests.rs). Each test checks one property, instantiated for both
+// `Ratio<i64>` (small components: the bound protects against the inherent
+// fixed-width overflow of Ratio<i64>, not any contract under test) and
+// `Ratio<BigInt>` (full range, exact).
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
